{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日でバースデーライブから\n1週間がたって、あの時は\n無我夢中だったけど思い返せば\nあの7時間半は楽しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服を公開するのはこれが初✨\n結構お気に入りです。\n全身撮れなかった...(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様1番好きな衣装何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとは時々真面目な話も\nするし、ふざけたりもするしで\n何でもウェルカムなお方です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから大好きなの(^▽^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業シーズン‼︎私もいよいよ\n中学から高校というものに\nかわります\n大きな一歩になるのかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"環境も変わると思うし\nいろんな事に対してもっと\n真剣に取り組めたらなあと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（＾∇＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、前回のコメントたくさん！\nありがとう✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこないだ大食いシスターズこと\n堀未央奈とご飯行きました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紀の善のあんみつ‼︎行ってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味だった〜o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなお姉ちゃんみたいな存在\n話も合うし(ほぼ食に関して)\n相談とかものってくれるし\nこれからも頼るけど許してね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろ〜んな話したなあ\n内緒だけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は鍋にハマってるんだ〜\n何鍋とかなく全部制覇したい‼︎\nおすすめの鍋とかお店とか\n教えて欲しいな〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なべなべー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日 ももこさん\n2日 てぃもーるさん\n4日 みやしたさん\nmatsuさん\nせきしゃさん\n7日 たけのこさん\n9日 けにーさん\n17日 メルセデスかずくんさん\n26日 りょう(赤いカーディガン)さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大撮影会楽しみだなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/01/1253455/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}